<h1>About, privacy and takedowns</h1>
<h2>What this is</h2>
<p>A community collection of menu layouts for the <a href="https://github.com/peppy6582/jellydisc">Disc Menus plugin for Jellyfin</a>.
It is not affiliated with Jellyfin or TMDB.</p>
<h2>Licence</h2>
<p>Every menu and listing is dedicated to the public domain under <a href="https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/">CC0 1.0</a>.
The tools and this site's code are GPL-3.0-only.</p>
<h2>What it does not contain</h2>
<p>No artwork, music or video. Menus describe layout and structure and refer to nothing hosted elsewhere.</p>
<h2>Privacy</h2>
<p>This site sets no cookies, runs no analytics, and loads nothing from third parties. It is hosted by GitHub Pages, which sees requests the way any web host does.
Clients are expected to match menus against a library on the user's own device.</p>
<h2>Takedowns</h2>
<p>If you hold rights in something here, open an issue titled "Takedown" naming the file. The menu is withdrawn first and discussed after.
Full details are in the <a href="https://github.com/peppy6582/jellydisc-menus/blob/main/POLICY.md">policy</a>.</p>
<h2>Attribution</h2>
<p>Movie and series ids are TMDB, IMDb and TVDB ids. This product uses the TMDB API but is not endorsed or certified by TMDB.</p>
